From: HardDinD developers
Subject: [EXPERIMENT] um: enable the existing rseq ABI for validation

Use the opt-in architecture hooks from 0029 without changing their code.
This candidate lets the same pipeline run the disabled and enabled builds
before CONFIG_UML_X86_RSEQ is selected in the production configuration.

--- a/arch/um/Kconfig
+++ b/arch/um/Kconfig
@@ -50,7 +50,7 @@
 	bool "Experimental x86-64 restartable sequences"
 	depends on X86_64
 	select HAVE_RSEQ
-	default n
+	default y
 	help
 	  Enable the generic rseq ABI for x86-64 UML tasks. CPU IDs come
 	  from the guest scheduler; scheduling and signal return use the
